<doc id="34349" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=34349" title="Jason Mraz">
Jason Mraz

Jason Mraz (Jason Thomas Mraz) nyaéta &lt;a href="musisi"&gt;musisi&lt;/a&gt; keturunan &lt;a href="Virginia"&gt;Virginia&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Ceko"&gt;Ceko&lt;/a&gt;. Aliran musik anu dipakéna nyaéta &lt;a href="reggae"&gt;reggae&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pop"&gt;pop&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="rock"&gt;rock&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jazz"&gt;jazz&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="hip-hop"&gt;hip-hop&lt;/a&gt;. Jason Mraz lahir tanggal &lt;a href="23%20Juni"&gt;23 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt;. Debut albumna dimimitian taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt; kalayan judul album WAITING FOR MY ROCKET TO COME. Di Acara Grammy Awards ka-51, single I'm yours dinominasikeun minangka Song of The Year. Jason Mraz dinominaskeun minangka Best Male Pop Vocal. Mraz kungsi tampil di &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; dina acara Java Jazz Festival &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, 6-7 Maret 2009. Taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, Jason bakal ngayakeun konsér deui di Indonésia. Ieu konsér dijudulan Jason Mraz Special Acoustic Evening With Toca Rivera, diayakeun di &lt;a href="Nusa%20Dua"&gt;Nusa Dua&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="9%20Nop%C3%A9mber"&gt;9 Nopémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Diskografi</h2>
Diskografi.
Saacan ngarilis album resmi, Jason Mraz ngarilis album LIVE AT JAVA JOE'S (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;). Diteruskeun album SOLD OUT (In Stereo) taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;. THE E MINOR EP IN F dirilis taun (&lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;). Album perdanana nyaéta WAITING FOR MY ROCET TO COME anu dirlis taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;. Diteruskeun ku album teu resmi TONIGHT, NOT AGAIN: jASON MRAZ LIVE AT EAGLE BALLROOM (&lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;). Album kaduana nyaéta MR. A-Z (&lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;), album GEEKIN' OUT ACROSS THE GALAXY (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;), taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt; kamari, Json Mraz ngarilis album WE SING, WE DANCE, WE STEAL THINGS kalayan lagu andalan i'm Yours. Ieu lagu aya dina 10 lagu pangpolérna di Billboard, Séptémber &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;. Malah mah di Bulan Oktober 2008, ieu album kajual leuwih ti 500 rébu kopi di &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt;. Nu pamungkas, Jason Mraz ngarilis album JASON MRAZ'S BEAUTIFUL MESS: LIVE ON EARTH TAUN &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;.
