<doc id="34379" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=34379" title="Air Supply">
Air Supply

Air Supply nyaéta grup duo &lt;a href="slow%20rock"&gt;slow rock&lt;/a&gt; anu kasohor kurang leuwih taun &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;an, anu dibentuk ku &lt;a href="Graham%20Russell"&gt;Graham Russell&lt;/a&gt;, musisi nu lahir di &lt;a href="Sherwood"&gt;Sherwood&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nottingham"&gt;Nottingham&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="11%20Juni"&gt;11 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1950"&gt;1950&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Russell%20Hitchcock"&gt;Russell Hitchcock&lt;/a&gt;, lalaki nu lahir di &lt;a href="Melbourne"&gt;Melbourne&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Victoria"&gt;Victoria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="15%20Juni"&gt;15 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1949"&gt;1949&lt;/a&gt;. Saacan jadi duo, ieu grup musik boga sababaraha personil, di antarana Chrissie Hammond, Jeremy Paul, Frank Esler-Smith, David Moyse, Rex Goh, David Green, Ralph Cooper. Ieu grup musik kabentuk nalika Graham jeung jeung Russel papanggih di pagelaran musikal Jesus Christ Superstar produksi &lt;a href="Andrew%20Lloyd%20Webber"&gt;Andrew Lloyd Webber&lt;/a&gt;/Tim Rice di &lt;a href="Sydney"&gt;Sydney&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="12%20Mei"&gt;12 Mei&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1975"&gt;1975&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Diskografi Album</h2>
Diskografi Album.
Nepi ka ayeuna, Air Supply geus ngarilis leuwih ti 10 album, di antarana: Air Supply (&lt;a href="1976"&gt;1976&lt;/a&gt;), Lost in Love (&lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;), The One That You Love (&lt;a href="1981"&gt;1981&lt;/a&gt;), Now and Forever (&lt;a href="1982"&gt;1982&lt;/a&gt;), Air Supply (2) (&lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;), Hearts in Motion (&lt;a href="1986"&gt;1986&lt;/a&gt;), The Christmas Album (&lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;), The Earth is... (&lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;), The Vanishing Race (&lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;), Greatest Hits Live... Now And Forever (&lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;), News from Nowhere (&lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;), The Book of Live (&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;), The Definitive Collection (&lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;), Yours Truly (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;), Across The Concrete Sky (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;), Playlist: The Very Best Of Air Supply (&lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;) jeung Mumbo Jumbo (&lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;).
