<doc id="34484" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=34484" title="Good Charlotte">
Good Charlotte

Good Charlotte nyaéta grup musik &lt;a href="rock"&gt;rock&lt;/a&gt; asal &lt;a href="Waldorf"&gt;Waldorf&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maryland"&gt;Maryland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt; anu dibentuk tanggal &lt;a href="1%20April"&gt;1 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt; ku Joel jeung Benji Madden. Madden sadulur-sadulur kainspirasi ku &lt;a href="Beastie%20Boys"&gt;Beastie Boys&lt;/a&gt; anu harita keur ngayakeun tur dina taun (&lt;a href="1995%29"&gt;1995)&lt;/a&gt;. Ngaran Good Charlotte sorangan dicokot tina salah sahiji judul buku bacaan budak GOOD CHARLOTTE: THE GIRLS OF GOOD DAY ORPHANAGE anu ditulis ku &lt;a href="Carol%20Beach%20York"&gt;Carol Beach York&lt;/a&gt;. Aliran musik ieu grup musik loba kapangaruhan ku &lt;a href="Blink-182"&gt;Blink-182&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sum%2041"&gt;Sum 41&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="NOFX"&gt;NOFX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Social%20Distortion"&gt;Social Distortion&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Green%20Day"&gt;Green Day&lt;/a&gt;. Personil Good Charlotte ayeuna di antarana: &lt;a href="Dean%20Butterworth"&gt;Dean Butterworth&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Joel%20Madden"&gt;Joel Madden&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Benji%20Madden"&gt;Benji Madden&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Billy%20Martin"&gt;Billy Martin&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Paul%20Thomas"&gt;Paul Thomas&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Diskografi Album</h2>
Diskografi Album.
Album pertama Good Charlotte dirilis taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; anu jadi awal karirna. Ieu album miboga tilu single, di antarana Little Things, Motivation Proclamation jeung Festival Song. &lt;a href="Aaron%20Escolopia"&gt;Aaron Escolopia&lt;/a&gt; nyaéta drummer Good Charlotte nalika ieu album dirilis. Escolopio kaluar saacan album kaduana THE YOUNG AND HOPELESS (&lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;) dirilis sabab Escolopio ngilu jeung grup musik adina, &lt;a href="Wakefield"&gt;Wakefield&lt;/a&gt;, terus posisina digantikeun ku &lt;a href="Josh%20Freese"&gt;Josh Freese&lt;/a&gt; (anu engké diganti deui sacara permanén ku &lt;a href="Chris%20Wilson"&gt;Chris Wilson&lt;/a&gt;). Album kadua ieu kajual nepi ka 4,9 juta kopi. Ngaliwatan ieu album, Good Charlotte aya dina puncak popularitasna. Single anu judulna Lifestyles of the Rich and Famous jadi jawara tangga lagu boh genre rock jeung &lt;a href="pop"&gt;pop&lt;/a&gt; di Sakuliah dunya. Ieu album ogé dilélér triple platinum. Album THE CHRONICLES OF LIFE AND DEATH dirilis taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, diteruskeun ku album GOOD MORNING REVIVAL anu dirilis taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;. Anu pamungkas, Good Charlotte ngarilis album CARDIOLOGY taun &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt; kamari.
